{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "5951144",
      "title": "Transition Phases",
      "lectureOrder": 713,
      "videoOrder": 656,
      "sourceHash": "2ee772ee450239740fe81926d95b351eb51d45860b69056512b08c7557a37c5a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.53,
          "end": 3.39,
          "en": "Instructor: Thus far, we only have starting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.39,
          "end": 4.26,
          "en": "and ending state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.26,
          "end": 6.69,
          "en": "Now, let's play around with the animate function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.69,
          "end": 9.99,
          "en": "We actually cannot only pass the timing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.99,
          "end": 13.17,
          "en": "we can control the whole animation and define",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.17,
          "end": 16.74,
          "en": "styles the animation should take during the animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.74,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "For that, I will pass a second argument here which is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 23.07,
          "en": "the style method. Again, we're already importing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 26.04,
          "en": "And as I can define a style in a state, I can also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "define a style during the animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 31.02,
          "en": "So here I also pass a JavaScript object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "and that in-between style will now be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 35.67,
          "en": "taken during the installation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.67,
          "end": 39.12,
          "en": "So here, let's say I want to give this a border",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.12,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "radius of 50 pixels. Now let's see how that looks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "If I save this with this extra style during the animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 50.22,
          "en": "if I hit shrink",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.22,
          "end": 52.92,
          "en": "you see, it now looks kind of ugly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.92,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "because now we let these border radius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 57.69,
          "en": "or we let it, well, get round,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.69,
          "end": 61.5,
          "en": "but once it finishes, it instantly jumps to the end state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.5,
          "end": 63.87,
          "en": "So this is not really what we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.87,
          "end": 68.01,
          "en": "We want to smoothly have this in between our animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.01,
          "end": 71.46000000000001,
          "en": "and not animate the changing of the border radius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "and then instantly jump to the end state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 78.57,
          "en": "To cater for such needs, we would replace this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.57,
          "end": 83.57,
          "en": "animate function here like this with an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.7,
          "end": 87.12,
          "en": "Now we can pass an array as a second argument to transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.12,
          "end": 91.17,
          "en": "and here we can also define starting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.17,
          "end": 94.28999999999999,
          "en": "and in-between states during this transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.28999999999999,
          "end": 98.523,
          "en": "So we could pass a style here and say background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.81,
          "end": 103.84700000000001,
          "en": "background color shall be orange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.75,
          "end": 106.95,
          "en": "That would be one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "Thereafter, the second element in this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "would be an animate function, which takes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 116.632,
          "en": "let's say, one second where I wanna animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.632,
          "end": 121.632,
          "en": "my border radius, as before. Border radius, 50 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.68,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "And now to avoid this ugly jump at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "I add another animate function of half a second",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 130.23,
          "en": "which will be executed after the border radius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.23,
          "end": 131.64,
          "en": "has been changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.64,
          "end": 133.95,
          "en": "Now, with that, we should instantly see a change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.95,
          "end": 137.52,
          "en": "to the background color to orange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.52,
          "end": 141.09,
          "en": "Thereafter, we should see the border radios developing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.09,
          "end": 143.13,
          "en": "over one second, and thereafter we should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.13,
          "end": 146.61,
          "en": "see the animation of, well, half a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.61,
          "end": 149.82,
          "en": "where we remove the border radius again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.82,
          "end": 153.48,
          "en": "Shrink the object, and turn it from orange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.48,
          "end": 156.32999999999998,
          "en": "back to our end state, which is green,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 158.64,
          "en": "for example, if we do shrink it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 159.57,
          "en": "Well, let's see this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.57,
          "end": 162.72,
          "en": "If I shrink it, we do indeed see it turn the aura orange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.72,
          "end": 166.02,
          "en": "see the border radius, and thereafter see it shrink",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.02,
          "end": 167.85,
          "en": "and the border radius being removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.85,
          "end": 170.25,
          "en": "And the same is true for animate back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.25,
          "end": 173.34,
          "en": "So with that, I got a more complex animation where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.34,
          "end": 175.07999999999998,
          "en": "I chain multiple styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.07999999999998,
          "end": 177.66,
          "en": "And while all this nesting here might look difficult,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.66,
          "end": 179.07,
          "en": "it actually isn't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.07,
          "end": 182.67,
          "en": "It only is an array passed to the transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.67,
          "end": 186.03,
          "en": "which allows us to define different phases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.03,
          "end": 187.44,
          "en": "in that transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.44,
          "end": 190.2,
          "en": "Starting phase, if no animate method is used,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.2,
          "end": 192.27,
          "en": "then it is instantly applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.27,
          "end": 195.78,
          "en": "Then, if we do add animate, we do apply a style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.78,
          "end": 198.57,
          "en": "but over some time, and if we have animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.57,
          "end": 201.24,
          "en": "without a style this means, basically, now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.24,
          "end": 204.75,
          "en": "transition to the end state, and this is how we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 204.75,
          "end": 205.95,
          "en": "set up our animation. Of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.95,
          "end": 209.19,
          "en": "we could have multiple in-between styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.19,
          "end": 211.56,
          "en": "The important thing is that you do end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.56,
          "end": 214.95,
          "en": "with animate 500, or whatever timing you have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.95,
          "end": 217.02,
          "en": "to get smoothly to the end state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.02,
          "end": 218.91,
          "en": "Otherwise, you will see what we had before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.91,
          "end": 221.64,
          "en": "that it instantly snaps back to your end state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.64,
          "end": 224.04,
          "en": "Probably not what you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.04,
          "end": 229.04,
          "en": "This is a more complex transition with the in-between steps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 229.14,
          "end": 231.24,
          "en": "but, I think, still manageable if you really",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 232.86,
          "en": "think about what's happening here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 232.86,
          "end": 235.143,
          "en": "with these different phases.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
